&_nc_oc=AdqpjGMBIkApEXbWpIw7d4bm611ykGwlYG9V6OWFA4LXuW4oIvSvYHU4aqvguOtOLSw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNKCfN8tgEx2E6_KTvFxp3DbG2CqNjg7pVS9fjLyfRFwA&oe=6AC1362F"}, {"file_name": "vlcsnap-2026-07-28-21h16m22s227.png", "id": "1028907503371969", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823351_1028907506705302_4733710544246166805_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HNdy__fiNkoQ7kNvwFeWQ89&_nc_oc=Ado4dXnS38NiR0E_txFW285qq7rl_f4d7WZkw4p_CeYNHgd9W_WFmhAi7uvAm_UUPIo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNh-9NCn2ODRduIKPigffEs4oqRz_hDIhoG0qngu7bMow&oe=6AC125ED"}, {"file_name": "vlcsnap-2026-07-28-21h14m47s863.png", "id": "1897785034472551", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673573223_1897785037805884_5940151767079708996_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-9H9gqpkb94Q7kNvwFXIV9L&_nc_oc=AdqY78F_T_2xU4TYUH89ywDNGt0MhgsLD6Ts0RO4viF6I5ANxrhRiLGLD1sAjde3TEc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM9P-blND-ksEI-TSkkyKxnNMqmrvconmOA8OkxZmTyXQ&oe=6AC1091C"}, {"file_name": "vlcsnap-2026-07-28-21h15m13s909.png", "id": "1747397439612949", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593858738_1747397446279615_3937584290932783368_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lhRs5Z_wAtgQ7kNvwFHfWCz&_nc_oc=AdpBjCTm5nzRL23nS_5Z3kQzSXxT7SKCi8BJAlHsdmAmFKDfwULf4hnNNJwhBmwLtxI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN9ISRuftqm7zDjJXdkR-sH1FhmFrR0FqG0OBxdl-MPfw&oe=6AC123F1"}, {"file_name": "vlcsnap-2026-07-28-21h17m47s545.png", "id": "27470374099300173", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673536876_27470374109300172_3318935900093651350_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Bl_Ryg_zh7IQ7kNvwGf4gT9&_nc_oc=AdrYhXvl6lPk-M6HFQBl42uKwn6zo9ab5Ult8kWZqsXwrYWpyNnbik3QtP12M6IUK4g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMUWEidm8ypMMHhrs5syUo1Kdueet3-alPfAQtG93S7Ng&oe=6AC1179B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Untitled(1)(1).png", "id": "2087130625540636", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828038_2087130628873969_7866446366568667079_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xh71XK9YhmAQ7kNvwEbNCZB&_nc_oc=AdpCylRziRe4ZcIL-WLK3-RSZkUURmxMfraQfESEsjgJON2GIyrsDsdI2hzUZSBTTEU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOl5fXKlYjVLRi29lXXR26X_8ebY6IMLgZb7d2xTH84Ig&oe=6AC134B2"}, "display_name": "Web Weaver", "keywords": ["swinging", "web", "parkour", "grapple", "movement"], "long_description": "**WEB WEAVER**\n\nSwing. Flail. Faceplant. Repeat.\n\nGrab a web, launch yourself off a skyscraper, and pray your aim was better than your judgment. Web Weaver is a physics-based web-swinging parkour game where every jump is one bad grip away from glorious disaster - and it's even funnier with friends.\n\n{1590796759424065}\n\n**BRING FRIENDS (IT'S FUNNIER)**\n\n Multiplayer mayhem. Swing together, knock each other off course, race through the city, or just dangle around being menaces. Everything is better with a squad of googly-eyed disasters.\n\n{1566776888280050}\n\n**SWING THROUGH THE CITY**\n\n Fully physics-driven web-swinging. No rails, no autopilot \u2014 just you, your grip, and gravity doing exactly what it wants. Nail a perfect arc between rooftops and feel like a god. Miss by a hair and eat pavement. Both are great.\n\n{1045542848436579}\n\n**DODGE THE CHAOS**\n\n Lasers. Obstacles. Traps that appear right where you were about to grab. The city is actively trying to end you, and the parkour gets meaner the deeper you go.\n\n{2230945841053332}\n\n**Grab a web. Get moving. Try not to scream.**", "short_description": "Physics-based web-swinging parkour. Dodge lasers, chain wild arcs, faceplant gloriously, and cause chaos with friends."}]}, "developer_name": "AP Development", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "